[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":270},["ShallowReactive",2],{"V2My5CZXYjEgmqVDxsdzoH5TUcfrBqjKfiPqDjXU6cg":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":44,"sector":45,"services":49,"introCopy":50,"storyblockAccordions":51,"storyblockAssets":61,"flexibleContent":84,"footerLinkLabel":262,"footerLinks":263},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Meat Liquor","MEATLiquor’s cult spirit fuels unique, unreplicable designs—15 sites in, the Dead Hippie lives on, proving rebellion and originality never go out of style.",null,"meat-liquor",true,{"hex":11},"#191919",{"hex":13},"#FAFAFA","Creators of the original bad boy bohemoth.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Meat\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Liquor\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":30,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":34},false,900,"",1600,{"width":33,"height":35,"url":36,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":37},899,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":38,"srcSet":39,"src":40,"width":41,"height":42,"sizes":43},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736778932-ch2b9724.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,1798,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Various, UK",[46],{"slug":47,"label":48},"hospitality","Hospitality","Art Direction, Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Being part of a cult movement from the start is very rare - but MEATLiquor is just that. Its anarchic brand spirit fuels a unique design for every location, making it impossible to replicate. The Dead Hippie is still alive and kicking 15 sites later...\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[52,55,58],{"title":53,"copy":54},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Take a pop up burger phenomenon and provide them with a permanent home and brand without loosing the original spirit and attitude.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":56,"copy":57},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Create a brand that defies convention, rejects establishment norms, and breaks away from predictable formulas, whilst maintaining a bold, unifying spirit that makes MEATLiquor unmistakably its own beast.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":59,"copy":60},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The approach was simple: a unique concept for every site, rooted in its location, mixed with a heavy dose of debauched anarchy and a no-nonsense take on operations. Working with our friends at I love dust to bring the graphics to life, enabled us to develop a bold, visual language now synonymous with the MEATliquor&rsquo;s cult status.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Credits: Artwork and video content by I Love Dust.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[62,72,82],{"isVideo":30,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":63},{"width":64,"height":65,"url":66,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":67},2094,1310,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736781596-shed_meatmarket02-2.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":68,"srcSet":69,"src":70,"width":64,"height":65,"sizes":71},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736781596-shed_meatmarket02-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736781596-shed_meatmarket02-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-asse